WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.175
The Centre for Israel and Jewish Affairs lobbied 56 percent of all Members of Parliament.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:14.087
Anthony Housefather received 67 lobbying contacts, making him the most lobbied MP in Canada by CIJA.

00:00:14.087 --> 00:00:19.875
The Commissioner of Lobbying exempted CIJA from gift limits for sponsored trips to Israel.
